Arcfront has launched its platform for training AI models on specialized data gathered directly from field experts. 

The company has 4 of the top 5 AI labs among its customers, less than a year after it started.

@arcfront has partnered with 300+ large companies, from hospitals to banks, to record how their experts are making important decisions. Examples include software rollback procedures, chip design planning, or M&A assessments.

posts.text_zh:
Arcfront 推出了一个用一线专家数据训练 AI 模型的平台。

成立不到一年，这家公司的客户就已包括五大顶级 AI 实验室中的四家。

@arcfront 已与 300 多家大型企业合作，从医院到银行，记录它们的专家如何做出关键决策，例如软件回滚流程、芯片设计规划或并购评估。

